const e="WHISPER : COREML = 0 | OPENVINO = 0 | CPU : SSE3 = 1 | SSSE3 = 1 | AVX = 1 | AVX2 = 1 | F16C = 1 | FMA = 1 | OPENMP = 1 | REPACK = 1 | ",o={type:"small",multilingual:!0,vocab:51865,audio:{ctx:1500,state:768,head:12,layer:12},text:{ctx:448,state:768,head:12,layer:12},mels:80,ftype:1},t={model:".\\models\\ggml-small.bin",language:"es",translate:!1},s={language:"es"},a=JSON.parse('[{"timestamps":{"from":"00:00:00,000","to":"00:00:03,000"},"offsets":{"from":0,"to":3000},"text":" En el mundo virtual es más importante que el regalo, así que..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:00:03,000","to":"00:00:16,000"},"offsets":{"from":3000,"to":16000},"text":" Bueno, ahora es un momento para empezar la operación así que se va a interrumpir."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:00:16,000","to":"00:00:20,000"},"offsets":{"from":16000,"to":20000},"text":" ¿Cómo andan?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:00:20,000","to":"00:00:21,000"},"offsets":{"from":20000,"to":21000},"text":" Muy bien."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:00:21,000","to":"00:00:23,000"},"offsets":{"from":21000,"to":23000},"text":" ¿Todo bien?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:00:23,000","to":"00:00:24,000"},"offsets":{"from":23000,"to":24000},"text":" Sí."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:00:24,000","to":"00:00:27,000"},"offsets":{"from":24000,"to":27000},"text":" Pero..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:00:27,000","to":"00:00:29,000"},"offsets":{"from":27000,"to":29000},"text":" ¿Vamos?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:00:29,000","to":"00:00:30,000"},"offsets":{"from":29000,"to":30000},"text":" Sí."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:00:30,000","to":"00:00:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":30000,"to":35000},"text":" Bueno..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:00:35,000","to":"00:00:41,000"},"offsets":{"from":35000,"to":41000},"text":" Bueno, empezamos y si se interrumpen..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:00:41,000","to":"00:00:43,000"},"offsets":{"from":41000,"to":43000},"text":" Vamos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:00:43,000","to":"00:00:47,000"},"offsets":{"from":43000,"to":47000},"text":" Bueno..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:00:59,000","to":"00:01:00,000"},"offsets":{"from":59000,"to":60000},"text":" Bueno..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:01:00,000","to":"00:01:08,000"},"offsets":{"from":60000,"to":68000},"text":" Bueno..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:01:08,000","to":"00:01:10,000"},"offsets":{"from":68000,"to":70000},"text":" Una preguntita en todo este tiempo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:01:10,000","to":"00:01:12,000"},"offsets":{"from":70000,"to":72000},"text":" ¿También quieren preguntar sobre algo?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:01:12,000","to":"00:01:13,000"},"offsets":{"from":72000,"to":73000},"text":" ¿Dudas?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:01:13,000","to":"00:01:21,000"},"offsets":{"from":73000,"to":81000},"text":" Bueno, hoy no hay ningún programa."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:01:21,000","to":"00:01:23,000"},"offsets":{"from":81000,"to":83000},"text":" Si no hay ninguna pregunta."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:01:23,000","to":"00:01:24,000"},"offsets":{"from":83000,"to":84000},"text":" ¿Un una?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:01:24,000","to":"00:01:25,000"},"offsets":{"from":84000,"to":85000},"text":" ¿Nada?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:01:26,000","to":"00:01:28,000"},"offsets":{"from":86000,"to":88000},"text":" Ya no sé..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:01:28,000","to":"00:01:32,000"},"offsets":{"from":88000,"to":92000},"text":" Pasó bastante."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:01:32,000","to":"00:01:33,000"},"offsets":{"from":92000,"to":93000},"text":" Ah, ok."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:01:33,000","to":"00:01:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":93000,"to":95000},"text":" Bueno..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:01:35,000","to":"00:01:39,000"},"offsets":{"from":95000,"to":99000},"text":" Vamos a empezar con las cosas generales, si os quiero."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:01:51,000","to":"00:02:01,000"},"offsets":{"from":111000,"to":121000},"text":" En el Corán se narra una historia de la vida de Abraham, el profeta Abraham, el padre de todas las religiones."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:02:01,000","to":"00:02:06,000"},"offsets":{"from":121000,"to":126000},"text":" Se lo escribe como él mismo era una nación en sí mismo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:02:06,000","to":"00:02:10,000"},"offsets":{"from":126000,"to":130000},"text":" Él estaba en la búsqueda de la verdad."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:02:12,000","to":"00:02:22,000"},"offsets":{"from":132000,"to":142000},"text":" Y esta es una historia muy linda que puede parecer simple, pero tiene, creo, casi el secreto de la existencia."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:02:22,000","to":"00:02:28,000"},"offsets":{"from":142000,"to":148000},"text":" Y Brahim se dio cuenta, Abraham se dio cuenta."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:02:28,000","to":"00:02:32,000"},"offsets":{"from":148000,"to":152000},"text":" En ese momento no existía el judaísmo como tal."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:02:32,000","to":"00:02:39,000"},"offsets":{"from":152000,"to":159000},"text":" Pero él se dio cuenta en su interior que anhelaba la realidad divina."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:02:41,000","to":"00:02:46,000"},"offsets":{"from":161000,"to":166000},"text":" Entonces, una noche, sin luna, vio las estrellas."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:02:46,000","to":"00:02:52,000"},"offsets":{"from":166000,"to":172000},"text":" Las vio hermosas, las vio elevadas, las vio luminosas."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:02:52,000","to":"00:02:56,000"},"offsets":{"from":172000,"to":176000},"text":" Y dijo, \\"Eso es Dios\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:02:56,000","to":"00:03:05,000"},"offsets":{"from":176000,"to":185000},"text":" Pero las, cuando vino a amanecer, las estrellas empezaron a desvanecerse."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:03:05,000","to":"00:03:09,000"},"offsets":{"from":185000,"to":189000},"text":" Entonces él dijo algo muy importante."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:03:09,000","to":"00:03:12,000"},"offsets":{"from":189000,"to":192000},"text":" \\"Yo no amo lo que se desvanece\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:03:12,000","to":"00:03:14,000"},"offsets":{"from":192000,"to":194000},"text":" Eso no es Dios."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:03:14,000","to":"00:03:23,000"},"offsets":{"from":194000,"to":203000},"text":" Siguió buscando y otra noche, miró a los cielos, siguió la luna llena, hermosa, radiante."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:03:23,000","to":"00:03:28,000"},"offsets":{"from":203000,"to":208000},"text":" Y entonces dijo, \\"Es Dios\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:03:28,000","to":"00:03:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":208000,"to":215000},"text":" Y después esa luna se desvaneció y dijo, \\"Yo no amo lo que se desvanece\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:03:36,000","to":"00:03:39,000"},"offsets":{"from":216000,"to":219000},"text":" Y después de día vio el sol, radiante."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:03:39,000","to":"00:03:44,000"},"offsets":{"from":219000,"to":224000},"text":" Luminoso, con sus rayos que llegaban a todos, imponente."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:03:44,000","to":"00:03:47,000"},"offsets":{"from":224000,"to":227000},"text":" Y dijo, \\"El sol es Dios\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:03:47,000","to":"00:03:54,000"},"offsets":{"from":227000,"to":234000},"text":" Y entonces llegó la noche y se fue el sol."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:03:54,000","to":"00:03:57,000"},"offsets":{"from":234000,"to":237000},"text":" Y dijo, \\"Yo no amo lo que se desvanece\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:03:57,000","to":"00:04:02,000"},"offsets":{"from":237000,"to":242000},"text":" Y en ese momento dijo una frase muy, muy, muy importante."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:04:03,000","to":"00:04:14,000"},"offsets":{"from":243000,"to":254000},"text":" \\"Volteo, me vuelvo, me oriento con todo mi ser al Señor de todos los mundos,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:04:14,000","to":"00:04:24,000"},"offsets":{"from":254000,"to":264000},"text":" aquel que no tiene principio y no tiene fin, aquel que sostiene todo, aquel que no perece,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:04:24,000","to":"00:04:30,000"},"offsets":{"from":264000,"to":270000},"text":" aquel que genera toda la vida y no es generado\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:04:31,000","to":"00:04:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":271000,"to":275000},"text":" O sea, él genera la vida pero no fue generado por nadie."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:04:35,000","to":"00:04:40,000"},"offsets":{"from":275000,"to":280000},"text":" En ese momento se abrió su corazón a la realidad divina."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:04:40,000","to":"00:04:46,000"},"offsets":{"from":280000,"to":286000},"text":" ¿Qué fueron esos estadios?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:04:46,000","to":"00:04:50,000"},"offsets":{"from":286000,"to":290000},"text":" Hay muchas explicaciones de qué es ese camino."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:04:50,000","to":"00:04:59,000"},"offsets":{"from":290000,"to":299000},"text":" Pero es entender que el retorno en nuestro camino personal de cada uno, en la religión que fuese,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:05:00,000","to":"00:05:09,000"},"offsets":{"from":300000,"to":309000},"text":" es un camino donde uno incrementa la certeza de su ser en la contemplación del eterno."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:05:09,000","to":"00:05:15,000"},"offsets":{"from":309000,"to":315000},"text":" Entonces, cuando nuestro ser se vuelve hacia algo de este mundo"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:05:15,000","to":"00:05:23,000"},"offsets":{"from":315000,"to":323000},"text":" y ponemos nuestra confianza en algo de este mundo, en algún momento vamos a encontrar que se desvanece."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:05:24,000","to":"00:05:32,000"},"offsets":{"from":324000,"to":332000},"text":" O tal vez que nos decepciona, porque nosotros estamos, cada uno de nosotros está buscando algo,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:05:32,000","to":"00:05:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":332000,"to":335000},"text":" por eso nos aferramos, pero ¿cuál es el error?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:05:35,000","to":"00:05:41,000"},"offsets":{"from":335000,"to":341000},"text":" Que nos aferramos muchas veces a algo que no vale la pena aferrarse."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:05:41,000","to":"00:05:51,000"},"offsets":{"from":341000,"to":351000},"text":" Cuando descubrimos esa estrella a la que nos encandila y decimos \\"esto es\\", por ahí no decimos \\"esto es Dios\\","},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:05:52,000","to":"00:06:01,000"},"offsets":{"from":352000,"to":361000},"text":" sentimos un apego y una atracción, tal o temprano, si no es el verdadero sol, la verdadera luna o la verdadera estrella,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:06:01,000","to":"00:06:06,000"},"offsets":{"from":361000,"to":366000},"text":" o sea, Dios nos vamos a decepcionar."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:06:06,000","to":"00:06:14,000"},"offsets":{"from":366000,"to":374000},"text":" Entonces, ¿en qué consiste el camino? En ver a dónde estamos orientados."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:06:14,000","to":"00:06:19,000"},"offsets":{"from":374000,"to":379000},"text":" Por eso se dice \\"el que se conoce a sí mismo conoce a su Señor\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:06:20,000","to":"00:06:26,000"},"offsets":{"from":380000,"to":386000},"text":" Lo primero que tenemos de conocer son esas falsas cosas a las que nos estamos orientando."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:06:26,000","to":"00:06:32,000"},"offsets":{"from":386000,"to":392000},"text":" Y el camino en qué consiste en decir \\"yo no amo lo que se desvanece\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:06:32,000","to":"00:06:41,000"},"offsets":{"from":392000,"to":401000},"text":" Entonces vamos hacia otro lugar, entonces lo primero que se hace en el camino es sacar aquello,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:06:41,000","to":"00:06:46,000"},"offsets":{"from":401000,"to":406000},"text":" no sé si están pasando abajo, esperamos un poquito y seguimos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:06:47,000","to":"00:06:52,000"},"offsets":{"from":407000,"to":412000},"text":" Ahora vamos a molestar. Ahora seguimos, ¿eh? Están rezándonos, vamos a hablar."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:06:52,000","to":"00:07:05,000"},"offsets":{"from":412000,"to":425000},"text":" Ahora se ha bien conectado."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:07:12,000","to":"00:07:17,000"},"offsets":{"from":432000,"to":437000},"text":" Hablo bajito."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:07:42,000","to":"00:07:51,000"},"offsets":{"from":462000,"to":471000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó! ¡Allah abligó! ¡Ya! ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:08:07,000","to":"00:08:12,000"},"offsets":{"from":487000,"to":492000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:08:37,000","to":"00:08:42,000"},"offsets":{"from":517000,"to":522000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:08:42,000","to":"00:08:50,000"},"offsets":{"from":522000,"to":530000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:08:50,000","to":"00:08:58,000"},"offsets":{"from":530000,"to":538000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:08:58,000","to":"00:09:04,000"},"offsets":{"from":538000,"to":544000},"text":" ¡Allah!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:09:07,000","to":"00:09:12,000"},"offsets":{"from":547000,"to":552000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:09:12,000","to":"00:09:17,000"},"offsets":{"from":552000,"to":557000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:09:17,000","to":"00:09:22,000"},"offsets":{"from":557000,"to":562000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:09:22,000","to":"00:09:27,000"},"offsets":{"from":562000,"to":567000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:09:27,000","to":"00:09:32,000"},"offsets":{"from":567000,"to":572000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:09:33,000","to":"00:09:38,000"},"offsets":{"from":573000,"to":578000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:09:38,000","to":"00:09:44,000"},"offsets":{"from":578000,"to":584000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:09:44,000","to":"00:09:50,000"},"offsets":{"from":584000,"to":590000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:09:50,000","to":"00:09:55,000"},"offsets":{"from":590000,"to":595000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:09:55,000","to":"00:10:01,000"},"offsets":{"from":595000,"to":601000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:10:02,000","to":"00:10:07,000"},"offsets":{"from":602000,"to":607000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:10:07,000","to":"00:10:14,000"},"offsets":{"from":607000,"to":614000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:10:14,000","to":"00:10:20,000"},"offsets":{"from":614000,"to":620000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:10:33,000","to":"00:10:37,000"},"offsets":{"from":633000,"to":637000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:10:37,000","to":"00:10:45,000"},"offsets":{"from":637000,"to":645000},"text":" ¡Allah abligó!"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:10:45,000","to":"00:11:00,000"},"offsets":{"from":645000,"to":660000},"text":" Entonces, el camino espiritual en todas las ramas reales de la espiritualidad consiste en descubrir aquello que nos toma y en lo que estamos en nuestra confianza."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:11:01,000","to":"00:11:06,000"},"offsets":{"from":661000,"to":666000},"text":" Porque todos esos astros falsos, en un momento, se van a desvanecer."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:11:06,000","to":"00:11:19,000"},"offsets":{"from":666000,"to":679000},"text":" Se pueden desvanecer en cualquier momento y si seguimos aferrados y no se desvanecen, se van a desvanecer en el momento más dramático de nuestra vida, en el último acto."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:11:20,000","to":"00:11:36,000"},"offsets":{"from":680000,"to":696000},"text":" La película, cuando puede estar buenísima, pero si el final es malo, uno dice que estuvo malísima. La película de nuestra vida tiene ese último acto que es cuando partimos de este mundo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:11:36,000","to":"00:11:39,000"},"offsets":{"from":696000,"to":699000},"text":" En ese momento, todos los telones se van a caer."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:11:42,000","to":"00:11:58,000"},"offsets":{"from":702000,"to":718000},"text":" O sea, todos esos apegos, si son falsos, si uno no limpió eso de su corazón, sino sacó eso que no es real y se volvió con todo su ser hacia lo único real, que es Dios, en algún momento nos vamos a decepcionar."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:11:58,000","to":"00:12:03,000"},"offsets":{"from":718000,"to":723000},"text":" Y lo que se entiende por una vida en el más allá de sufrimiento depende de eso."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:12:03,000","to":"00:12:10,000"},"offsets":{"from":723000,"to":730000},"text":" Y lo que se entiende por una vida en el más allá de felicidad, o sea, después de este mundo, depende de eso."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:12:11,000","to":"00:12:15,000"},"offsets":{"from":731000,"to":735000},"text":" Porque lo que nos llevamos a este mundo es ese contacto con lo eterno."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:12:15,000","to":"00:12:27,000"},"offsets":{"from":735000,"to":747000},"text":" Y este contacto que están haciendo acá, la única intención que tiene es que ese corazón, esa parte espiritual, reviva y se reconecte."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:12:28,000","to":"00:12:41,000"},"offsets":{"from":748000,"to":761000},"text":" Cuando terminaron que dijeron \\"está férula\\", \\"está férula\\", \\"está férula\\", ¿saben qué significa? Busco, pido y anir el perdón de Dios. Busco, pido y anir el perdón de Dios tres veces."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:12:41,000","to":"00:12:47,000"},"offsets":{"from":761000,"to":767000},"text":" Porque todo lo que hacemos es voltearnos de lo falso a lo real."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:12:48,000","to":"00:12:59,000"},"offsets":{"from":768000,"to":779000},"text":" Y cuando tomamos conciencia de que estábamos en esa vida falsa y nos volteamos hacia lo real, eso se llama arrepentimiento."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:12:59,000","to":"00:13:05,000"},"offsets":{"from":779000,"to":785000},"text":" Ese es el arrepentimiento. De hecho, ese es el pecado más grave que tenemos como seres humanos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:13:05,000","to":"00:13:17,000"},"offsets":{"from":785000,"to":797000},"text":" Después están los pecados, obviamente, que uno comete. Pero uno puede ser una persona buena, pero estar lleno de falsedades de su interior."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:13:18,000","to":"00:13:27,000"},"offsets":{"from":798000,"to":807000},"text":" Y eso es lo más difícil de nuestro interior. ¿Cómo lo logramos entendiendo en nuestros corazones que dependemos de Dios?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:13:27,000","to":"00:13:37,000"},"offsets":{"from":807000,"to":817000},"text":" Y depender de Dios es un alivio enorme. Es un alivio enorme. Porque querramos o no querramos, vamos a depender de algo o de alguien."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:13:38,000","to":"00:13:49,000"},"offsets":{"from":818000,"to":829000},"text":" Vamos a depender del sueldo, del jefe, del negocio, de esto, del otro, de mi ley, de el exquisitor, de uno, del otro. Vamos a depender."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:13:49,000","to":"00:13:56,000"},"offsets":{"from":829000,"to":836000},"text":" Pero cuando entendemos que nada de este mundo determina nuestro estado, nada de este mundo nos puede dar o quitar."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:13:56,000","to":"00:14:06,000"},"offsets":{"from":836000,"to":846000},"text":" Sino que hay algo más allá de todo este escenario que es Dios. Y ponemos nuestra confianza ahí. Empezamos a hacer lo que hizo Abraham."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:14:07,000","to":"00:14:17,000"},"offsets":{"from":847000,"to":857000},"text":" Empezamos a decir, esto no es Dios. Esto no es lo que busco. Esto no es lo que anilo. Lo que anilo está más allá de esto."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:14:17,000","to":"00:14:19,000"},"offsets":{"from":857000,"to":859000},"text":" ¿Sí?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:14:19,000","to":"00:14:23,000"},"offsets":{"from":859000,"to":863000},"text":" Entonces, el..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:14:23,000","to":"00:14:26,000"},"offsets":{"from":863000,"to":866000},"text":" Perdón un poquito de..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:14:26,000","to":"00:14:28,000"},"offsets":{"from":866000,"to":868000},"text":" ¿Dónde?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:14:28,000","to":"00:14:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":868000,"to":875000},"text":" El sufrimo no es una escuela filosófica. Preguntan si es una escuela filosófica el sufrimo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:14:37,000","to":"00:14:40,000"},"offsets":{"from":877000,"to":880000},"text":" El sufrimo. El sufrimo es..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:14:40,000","to":"00:14:50,000"},"offsets":{"from":880000,"to":890000},"text":" Cada religión, en todas las religiones, es una rama que era el núcleo de esa religión."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:14:50,000","to":"00:14:59,000"},"offsets":{"from":890000,"to":899000},"text":" El sufrimo sería el núcleo del islamo. O sea, la espiritualidad del islamo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:15:01,000","to":"00:15:07,000"},"offsets":{"from":901000,"to":907000},"text":" Todas las religiones tienen. Todas las religiones tienen. Hay religiones en las que eso..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:15:07,000","to":"00:15:10,000"},"offsets":{"from":907000,"to":910000},"text":" Sí, hay religiones en donde..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:15:10,000","to":"00:15:22,000"},"offsets":{"from":910000,"to":922000},"text":" Son de distintas formas, ¿no? De distintas formas. Pero muchas veces esa parte espiritual se va extinguiendo también muchas veces, ¿no?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:15:23,000","to":"00:15:31,000"},"offsets":{"from":923000,"to":931000},"text":" Por ejemplo, el cristianico. Yo era cristiano. Esa parte espiritual casi no existe. O sea, no hay..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:15:31,000","to":"00:15:38,000"},"offsets":{"from":931000,"to":938000},"text":" Uno puede... que existen lo que se llama los pares, el desierto, que son morasterios. Pero uno que va a ir a un morasterio..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:15:38,000","to":"00:15:41,000"},"offsets":{"from":938000,"to":941000},"text":" No tiene asidero."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:15:41,000","to":"00:15:45,000"},"offsets":{"from":941000,"to":945000},"text":" ¿Pero en cuál es el sentido de la vida de aquí?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:15:45,000","to":"00:15:50,000"},"offsets":{"from":945000,"to":950000},"text":" El sentido y la vida... Esperamos que terminemos y ya la llevo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:15:53,000","to":"00:16:22,000"},"offsets":{"from":953000,"to":982000},"text":" [Música]"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:16:23,000","to":"00:16:25,000"},"offsets":{"from":983000,"to":985000},"text":" Acá me preguntan por el sentido de la vida."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:16:25,000","to":"00:16:33,000"},"offsets":{"from":985000,"to":993000},"text":" El sentido de la vida tiene distintos aspectos. ¿Sí?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:16:33,000","to":"00:16:36,000"},"offsets":{"from":993000,"to":996000},"text":" ¿El sentido de la vida para un burro? ¿Cuál es?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:16:36,000","to":"00:16:41,000"},"offsets":{"from":996000,"to":1001000},"text":" Estar con la burra y comer pasto. ¿Sí?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:16:41,000","to":"00:16:46,000"},"offsets":{"from":1001000,"to":1006000},"text":" Ese es el sentido de la vida. Una vez, cuando se estaba inaugurando una mezquita..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:16:47,000","to":"00:16:53,000"},"offsets":{"from":1007000,"to":1013000},"text":" Una mezquita de bellacit fue un gran cheque de sufismo, hacer el sermón de apertura."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:16:53,000","to":"00:16:59,000"},"offsets":{"from":1013000,"to":1019000},"text":" Estantos preparados y una persona entró corriendo y dijo \\"Mi burro, mi burro\\" empezó a irritar."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:16:59,000","to":"00:17:03,000"},"offsets":{"from":1019000,"to":1023000},"text":" \\"Para, para, tranquilo\\", dijo el cheque. \\"Yo te voy a encontrar tu burro\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:17:03,000","to":"00:17:09,000"},"offsets":{"from":1023000,"to":1029000},"text":" Dijo \\"¿Hay alguien que no haya llamado? ¿Hay alguien que no haya sentido amor en su corazón?\\""},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:17:09,000","to":"00:17:13,000"},"offsets":{"from":1029000,"to":1033000},"text":" Preguntó. Todos se quedaron callados porque sabían qué pasa."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:17:14,000","to":"00:17:18,000"},"offsets":{"from":1034000,"to":1038000},"text":" Uno levantó la mano y dije \\"Yo\\", y otro, después otro y después uno más."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:17:18,000","to":"00:17:21,000"},"offsets":{"from":1038000,"to":1041000},"text":" Tres personas levantaron la mano, ¿no?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:17:21,000","to":"00:17:24,000"},"offsets":{"from":1041000,"to":1044000},"text":" Dijo \\"Mira, buscabas un burro, ahora tenés tres\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:17:24,000","to":"00:17:32,000"},"offsets":{"from":1044000,"to":1052000},"text":" Parece un chiste, pero es así. ¿Cuál es el sentido de tu cuerpo?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:17:32,000","to":"00:17:38,000"},"offsets":{"from":1052000,"to":1058000},"text":" Nada. Tu cuerpo está... Lo único que le interesa es el sensorio. ¿Sí?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:17:38,000","to":"00:17:43,000"},"offsets":{"from":1058000,"to":1063000},"text":" Pero hay algo más allá de tu cuerpo, que es tu alma. ¿Sí?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:17:44,000","to":"00:17:47,000"},"offsets":{"from":1064000,"to":1067000},"text":" Ahora, esa alma tiene que despertarse."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:17:47,000","to":"00:17:52,000"},"offsets":{"from":1067000,"to":1072000},"text":" Cuando se despierte, hay un alimento. Tu cuerpo necesita un alimento, que es lo material."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:17:52,000","to":"00:17:59,000"},"offsets":{"from":1072000,"to":1079000},"text":" Hay un alimento espiritual que tiene que ver con conectarse o estar en la presencia adivina."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:17:59,000","to":"00:18:04,000"},"offsets":{"from":1079000,"to":1084000},"text":" O acercarse a la presencia adivina, o caminar de eso falso hacia eso verdadero."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:18:04,000","to":"00:18:11,000"},"offsets":{"from":1084000,"to":1091000},"text":" Ahora, yo te lo estoy contando en palabras, pero no te sirve para nada."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:18:12,000","to":"00:18:14,000"},"offsets":{"from":1092000,"to":1094000},"text":" Porque lo tenés que vivir."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:18:14,000","to":"00:18:21,000"},"offsets":{"from":1094000,"to":1101000},"text":" Entonces, cuando tu corazón se despierte, nada de este mundo lo vas a satisfacer."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:18:21,000","to":"00:18:30,000"},"offsets":{"from":1101000,"to":1110000},"text":" El corán dice \\"Yo los creé a ustedes para que me conozcan, para que me amen\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:18:30,000","to":"00:18:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":1110000,"to":1115000},"text":" Pero te lo pueden decir, pero vos tenés que descubrirlo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:18:35,000","to":"00:18:40,000"},"offsets":{"from":1115000,"to":1120000},"text":" O sea, no es que vos tenés que descubrirlo, vos tenés que experimentarlo en tu corazón espiritual."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:18:41,000","to":"00:18:50,000"},"offsets":{"from":1121000,"to":1130000},"text":" Entonces, cuando vos pruebes una pizca de salud, o una cucharada de samil, te dices \\"Ah, es por acá\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:18:50,000","to":"00:18:57,000"},"offsets":{"from":1130000,"to":1137000},"text":" Y entonces vos vas a encontrar que ese sentido no tiene fin."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:18:57,000","to":"00:19:01,000"},"offsets":{"from":1137000,"to":1141000},"text":" Y ese sentido es voltearse permanentemente a ese conocimiento de lo otro."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:19:01,000","to":"00:19:07,000"},"offsets":{"from":1141000,"to":1147000},"text":" Eso se manifiesta en la vida. No trastes de \\"Con esto no lo vas a entender en tu vida\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:19:08,000","to":"00:19:12,000"},"offsets":{"from":1148000,"to":1152000},"text":" O sea, lo puedes entender con la cabeza, pero no te vas a llorar nada."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:19:12,000","to":"00:19:19,000"},"offsets":{"from":1152000,"to":1159000},"text":" Uno lo entiende para entender conceptos, pero esto tiene que ver con un trabajo interior y espiritual."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:19:19,000","to":"00:19:26,000"},"offsets":{"from":1159000,"to":1166000},"text":" Entonces, vos tenés que buscar en tu corazón qué es lo que querés entender."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:19:26,000","to":"00:19:34,000"},"offsets":{"from":1166000,"to":1174000},"text":" Y si vos decís \\"Esto no, esto no, esto no\\", en algún momento vas a empezar a limpiar tu interior"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:19:35,000","to":"00:19:41,000"},"offsets":{"from":1175000,"to":1181000},"text":" y vas a encontrar que hay nada de este mundo que va a satisfacer esa necesidad intrínseca que está grabada en tu corazón."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:19:41,000","to":"00:19:49,000"},"offsets":{"from":1181000,"to":1189000},"text":" ¿Por qué? Porque nosotros, antes de entrar en este mundo, estábamos en un estado de leite espiritual en la presencia divina."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:19:49,000","to":"00:19:52,000"},"offsets":{"from":1189000,"to":1192000},"text":" Y esa necesidad está grabada en nosotros."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:19:52,000","to":"00:19:58,000"},"offsets":{"from":1192000,"to":1198000},"text":" Ahora, ¿para qué venimos a este mundo? Para conocer a Dios en otro nivel de presencia."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:19:58,000","to":"00:20:01,000"},"offsets":{"from":1198000,"to":1201000},"text":" O sea, acercarnos aún más a Él."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:20:02,000","to":"00:20:10,000"},"offsets":{"from":1202000,"to":1210000},"text":" Ahora, ¿te puedo contar este cuento? Te puedo explicar un montón de ejemplos, pero esto se experimenta."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:20:10,000","to":"00:20:14,000"},"offsets":{"from":1210000,"to":1214000},"text":" Por eso, el camino espiritual se abre o no se abre."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:20:14,000","to":"00:20:22,000"},"offsets":{"from":1214000,"to":1222000},"text":" Y no es una filosofía, porque la filosofía para nosotros, bueno, algunos se pueden enojar con lo que digo, pero no sirve para nada."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:20:22,000","to":"00:20:31,000"},"offsets":{"from":1222000,"to":1231000},"text":" En sí misma, es una vivencia, no es una locuración mental, sino que es una vivencia espiritual."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:20:32,000","to":"00:20:36,000"},"offsets":{"from":1232000,"to":1236000},"text":" Ahora, para que empiece ese camino, se tiene que despertar algo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:20:36,000","to":"00:20:39,000"},"offsets":{"from":1236000,"to":1239000},"text":" ¿Estamos de acuerdo?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:20:39,000","to":"00:20:54,000"},"offsets":{"from":1239000,"to":1254000},"text":" Entonces, por ejemplo, dice el Corán, \\"Y a quien Dios le quiera hacer un bien, le expande esa conciencia interior en la luz de la sumisión a su mandato\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:20:54,000","to":"00:20:56,000"},"offsets":{"from":1254000,"to":1256000},"text":" O sea, se expande interiormente."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:20:56,000","to":"00:20:59,000"},"offsets":{"from":1256000,"to":1259000},"text":" Y el mundo espiritual no tiene límites."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:21:00,000","to":"00:21:08,000"},"offsets":{"from":1260000,"to":1268000},"text":" Nosotros entendemos todo de una manera materialista."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:21:08,000","to":"00:21:14,000"},"offsets":{"from":1268000,"to":1274000},"text":" ¿Por qué? Porque nosotros creemos que nosotros tocamos, sentimos, y eso es lo que le damos a la entidad."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:21:14,000","to":"00:21:19,000"},"offsets":{"from":1274000,"to":1279000},"text":" Pero el mundo espiritual, que se abre cuando uno empiece ese camino, no tiene límites."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:21:19,000","to":"00:21:27,000"},"offsets":{"from":1279000,"to":1287000},"text":" Por eso, el profeta, la paz y las bendiciones sean con él, dijo, \\"Cuando ustedes hacen el salat\\", el salat es esto que está acá, lo hicieron recién."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:21:28,000","to":"00:21:31,000"},"offsets":{"from":1288000,"to":1291000},"text":" El corazón, el alma abuela hacia Dios, o sea, se va del cuarto."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:21:31,000","to":"00:21:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":1291000,"to":1295000},"text":" O sea, es un ejercicio espiritual."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:21:35,000","to":"00:21:51,000"},"offsets":{"from":1295000,"to":1311000},"text":" Hay una historia que ocurrió con un gran santo de nuestro camino, que una vez le habían clavado una flecha a través del talón, le dolía muchísimo, le dolía muchísimo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:21:51,000","to":"00:21:55,000"},"offsets":{"from":1311000,"to":1315000},"text":" Entonces, se la quería sacar y no lo aguantaba."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:21:56,000","to":"00:22:00,000"},"offsets":{"from":1316000,"to":1320000},"text":" ¿Qué pasó? Dijo, \\"Esperen que empiece mi ignoración\\". Cuando empiece mi ignoración, me la sacas."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:22:00,000","to":"00:22:09,000"},"offsets":{"from":1320000,"to":1329000},"text":" Entonces, él dijo al lajuacpar, que significa básicamente todo lo que yo percebo es nada frente a la presencia divina."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:22:09,000","to":"00:22:12,000"},"offsets":{"from":1329000,"to":1332000},"text":" Y uno hace este gesto y deja todo atrás."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:22:12,000","to":"00:22:15,000"},"offsets":{"from":1332000,"to":1335000},"text":" En ese momento se consagra a Dios."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:22:15,000","to":"00:22:23,000"},"offsets":{"from":1335000,"to":1343000},"text":" Pero, obviamente, eso tiene niveles. Uno lo puede entender con la cabeza, o uno lo puede entender con el corazón, y el corazón tiene infinitos niveles."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:22:24,000","to":"00:22:29,000"},"offsets":{"from":1344000,"to":1349000},"text":" Entonces, cuando empezó su oración, fueron de atrás y le rompieron las flechas y la sacaron."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:22:29,000","to":"00:22:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":1349000,"to":1355000},"text":" Cuando terminó su oración, como terminaron ahora, preguntó, \\"¿Ya me la sacaron?\\""},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:22:35,000","to":"00:22:43,000"},"offsets":{"from":1355000,"to":1363000},"text":" Entonces, sé que hasta es un concepto trillado el tema del alma y del cuerpo, ¿no?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:22:43,000","to":"00:22:46,000"},"offsets":{"from":1363000,"to":1366000},"text":" Pero es real. Es real."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:22:46,000","to":"00:22:51,000"},"offsets":{"from":1366000,"to":1371000},"text":" Y hasta que uno no empiece ese camino de descubrimiento, no va a ver esa realidad."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:22:52,000","to":"00:22:55,000"},"offsets":{"from":1372000,"to":1375000},"text":" A veces nos dijeron del cuerpo y del alma, del cuerpo y del alma, desde que somos chiquitos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:22:55,000","to":"00:23:01,000"},"offsets":{"from":1375000,"to":1381000},"text":" Pero uno tiene que poder despertar esa parte para que ese camino se abra."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:23:01,000","to":"00:23:11,000"},"offsets":{"from":1381000,"to":1391000},"text":" ¿Cómo se hace eso? En primer lugar, manteniendo ese fuego interior abierto, ese busque de espíritu de la abierta."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:23:11,000","to":"00:23:17,000"},"offsets":{"from":1391000,"to":1397000},"text":" Y empezando a decir, \\"esto no es, esto no es, esto no es\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:23:18,000","to":"00:23:28,000"},"offsets":{"from":1398000,"to":1408000},"text":" O sea, se genera una búsqueda y una necesidad. En esa búsqueda y esa necesidad, no hay posibilidad de que el buscador no arriba."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:23:28,000","to":"00:23:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":1408000,"to":1415000},"text":" Si es sincero, Dios dice, \\"Si ustedes quieren acercarse a mí, yo me voy a manifestar a ustedes\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:23:35,000","to":"00:23:41,000"},"offsets":{"from":1415000,"to":1421000},"text":" Si ustedes caminan un paso hacia mí, yo voy a correr hacia ustedes."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:23:43,000","to":"00:23:53,000"},"offsets":{"from":1423000,"to":1433000},"text":" Si ustedes se acercan hasta que yo me voy a convertir, dice Dios, en los ojos con los que ven, en la mano con la que agarran, en la lengua con la que hablan."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:23:53,000","to":"00:24:02,000"},"offsets":{"from":1433000,"to":1442000},"text":" El misterio de la vida, nadie te lo puede abrir. El misterio de la vida lo tienes que descubrir vos y para eso estás acá."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:24:02,000","to":"00:24:10,000"},"offsets":{"from":1442000,"to":1450000},"text":" Para eso estás acá. Y no tiene nada que ver con este mundo. No tiene nada que ver con todos los códigos de valor en este mundo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:24:11,000","to":"00:24:22,000"},"offsets":{"from":1451000,"to":1462000},"text":" Pero lo peor que te puede pasar es que se termine la película de tu vida y no hayas descubierto eso, pues no hayas sentido ese amor por lo trascendente."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:24:22,000","to":"00:24:32,000"},"offsets":{"from":1462000,"to":1472000},"text":" Ahora es interesante, ese amor es lo que trasciende, que no tiene absolutamente nada que ver con esto físico."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:24:33,000","to":"00:24:43,000"},"offsets":{"from":1473000,"to":1483000},"text":" Ese amor por lo eterno, ese amor por Dios. Pero esos, ¿cómo va a amar uno lo eterno? Tiene que primero vaciarse de todo aquello que es falso."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:24:43,000","to":"00:24:50,000"},"offsets":{"from":1483000,"to":1490000},"text":" Cuando vos limpiás tu corazón de todo lo que no es, ya poquito se puede abrir lo que es."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:24:59,000","to":"00:25:04,000"},"offsets":{"from":1499000,"to":1504000},"text":" ¿Qué lugar tiene el cuerpo en la vivienda?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:25:04,000","to":"00:25:12,000"},"offsets":{"from":1504000,"to":1512000},"text":" El cuerpo en la vivienda, no es allá de que yo voy a trascender o es a través de ellos que se puede trascender."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:25:12,000","to":"00:25:16,000"},"offsets":{"from":1512000,"to":1516000},"text":" ¿Qué lugar tiene el cuerpo en el camino espiritual?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:25:16,000","to":"00:25:23,000"},"offsets":{"from":1516000,"to":1523000},"text":" Bueno, el cuerpo es un medio y el cuerpo es algo que tenemos que cuidar."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:25:24,000","to":"00:25:32,000"},"offsets":{"from":1524000,"to":1532000},"text":" Cada cosa en este camino tiene su derecho, entonces uno tiene que cuidar su cuerpo, uno tiene que mantenerlo saludable,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:25:32,000","to":"00:25:37,000"},"offsets":{"from":1532000,"to":1537000},"text":" porque son como amanas, son como cosas que nos da Dios para que cuidemos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:25:37,000","to":"00:25:43,000"},"offsets":{"from":1537000,"to":1543000},"text":" De hecho, todo lo que tenemos es algo que nos da Dios para que lo cuidemos y lo mantengamos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:25:43,000","to":"00:25:49,000"},"offsets":{"from":1543000,"to":1549000},"text":" Exactamente, todo lo que tenemos es algo que nos dan por un tiempo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:25:50,000","to":"00:25:54,000"},"offsets":{"from":1550000,"to":1554000},"text":" La salud es un regalo de Dios, es uno de los regalos más grandes que tenemos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:25:54,000","to":"00:26:00,000"},"offsets":{"from":1554000,"to":1560000},"text":" Cualquiera que está en farm o un rato dice, cualquier dolor más chiquito que sea, es increíble lo que tenía."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:26:00,000","to":"00:26:09,000"},"offsets":{"from":1560000,"to":1569000},"text":" Bueno, es el lugar, o sea, uno tiene que comprender que a ver nosotros no nos convertimos en algo espiritual,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:26:09,000","to":"00:26:17,000"},"offsets":{"from":1569000,"to":1577000},"text":" y todo espiritualidad y no hay, no, nosotros tenemos una vida, nosotros tenemos relaciones, relaciones humanas."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:26:18,000","to":"00:26:24,000"},"offsets":{"from":1578000,"to":1584000},"text":" O sea, por eso. Pero cada cosa se vuelve a orientarse hacia Dios."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:26:24,000","to":"00:26:30,000"},"offsets":{"from":1584000,"to":1590000},"text":" Entonces, cuando uno recibe la comida, la recibe como un regalo de Dios."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:26:30,000","to":"00:26:39,000"},"offsets":{"from":1590000,"to":1599000},"text":" Cuando agradece al que la sirvió y al que la trajo y al que la aprovechó."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:26:39,000","to":"00:26:42,000"},"offsets":{"from":1599000,"to":1602000},"text":" Pero uno entiende como un regalo de Dios."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:26:43,000","to":"00:26:49,000"},"offsets":{"from":1603000,"to":1609000},"text":" Cuando uno trabaja, uno entiende que ese trabajo tiene que convertirse en un acto de servicio a Dios."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:26:49,000","to":"00:26:54,000"},"offsets":{"from":1609000,"to":1614000},"text":" Y como lo convertimos en un acto de servicio a Dios, intentando de que sea la mejor manera posible."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:26:54,000","to":"00:26:57,000"},"offsets":{"from":1614000,"to":1617000},"text":" Intentando lo que sea con excelencia."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:26:57,000","to":"00:27:02,000"},"offsets":{"from":1617000,"to":1622000},"text":" Dios ama lo que sea de manera excelente, o sea, con todo el corazón."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:27:02,000","to":"00:27:12,000"},"offsets":{"from":1622000,"to":1632000},"text":" Entonces, todo en esta vida, o sea, uno puede vivir esta vida completa."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:27:13,000","to":"00:27:21,000"},"offsets":{"from":1633000,"to":1641000},"text":" Y tantamente dormir, o sea, resolviendo impulsos, resolviendo problemas, ten un problema, lo resolves,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:27:21,000","to":"00:27:25,000"},"offsets":{"from":1641000,"to":1645000},"text":" me llamaron, es una acción y reacción permanente que no termina."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:27:25,000","to":"00:27:28,000"},"offsets":{"from":1645000,"to":1648000},"text":" Y las situaciones no dejan de venir."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:27:28,000","to":"00:27:32,000"},"offsets":{"from":1648000,"to":1652000},"text":" Bien, y de nuevo, pasó esto, pasó lo otro."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:27:32,000","to":"00:27:38,000"},"offsets":{"from":1652000,"to":1658000},"text":" Esto, lo otro, bueno, ahora con redes sociales y las noticias, no para."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:27:38,000","to":"00:27:41,000"},"offsets":{"from":1658000,"to":1661000},"text":" Y uno está como una máquina respondiendo, tata, tata, tata."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:27:42,000","to":"00:27:51,000"},"offsets":{"from":1662000,"to":1671000},"text":" O uno puede lo mismo que hace, lo mismo que hace poner la luz de la intención en lo que hace."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:27:51,000","to":"00:27:55,000"},"offsets":{"from":1671000,"to":1675000},"text":" La luz de la intención requiere algo de día en el corazón."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:27:55,000","to":"00:28:00,000"},"offsets":{"from":1675000,"to":1680000},"text":" Entonces, uno empieza a hacer las cosas con un sentido."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:28:00,000","to":"00:28:05,000"},"offsets":{"from":1680000,"to":1685000},"text":" ¿Cómo las hace con un sentido? Por ejemplo, diciendo en el nombre de Dios."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:28:06,000","to":"00:28:12,000"},"offsets":{"from":1686000,"to":1692000},"text":" O sea, uno puede tomar esto y es simplemente la satisfacción para el cuerpo,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:28:12,000","to":"00:28:17,000"},"offsets":{"from":1692000,"to":1697000},"text":" o uno puede tomar esa satisfacción para el cuerpo y decir en el nombre de Dios."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:28:17,000","to":"00:28:21,000"},"offsets":{"from":1697000,"to":1701000},"text":" Entonces, el acto físico traciende lo que es simplemente físico."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:28:21,000","to":"00:28:26,000"},"offsets":{"from":1701000,"to":1706000},"text":" Entonces, todo lo que uno hace puede revestirse de intención."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:28:26,000","to":"00:28:33,000"},"offsets":{"from":1706000,"to":1713000},"text":" Entonces, esa intención que es atención, conciencia y orientación."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:28:34,000","to":"00:28:36,000"},"offsets":{"from":1714000,"to":1716000},"text":" Me vuelvo hacia Dios."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:28:36,000","to":"00:28:40,000"},"offsets":{"from":1716000,"to":1720000},"text":" Entonces, todos los actos se convierten en algo consciente."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:28:40,000","to":"00:28:43,000"},"offsets":{"from":1720000,"to":1723000},"text":" Y todos los actos se convierten en una acta de oración."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:28:43,000","to":"00:28:47,000"},"offsets":{"from":1723000,"to":1727000},"text":" Entonces, la vida toma otro sentido."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:28:47,000","to":"00:28:49,000"},"offsets":{"from":1727000,"to":1729000},"text":" La vida toma otro sentido."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:28:49,000","to":"00:28:53,000"},"offsets":{"from":1729000,"to":1733000},"text":" ¿Por qué? Porque todo se vuelve algo que se oriente hacia la meta de uno."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:28:53,000","to":"00:28:56,000"},"offsets":{"from":1733000,"to":1736000},"text":" No es simplemente hacer por hacer, ¿sí?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:28:56,000","to":"00:28:59,000"},"offsets":{"from":1736000,"to":1739000},"text":" De hecho, uno todo el tiempo, todo el día, muchas veces con las..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:28:59,000","to":"00:29:02,000"},"offsets":{"from":1739000,"to":1742000},"text":" Uno se encuentra, a veces digo, ¿por qué está haciendo esto?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:29:03,000","to":"00:29:07,000"},"offsets":{"from":1743000,"to":1747000},"text":" Yo estoy haciendo, porque entramos en un ciclo de reactividad que nos duerme."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:29:07,000","to":"00:29:15,000"},"offsets":{"from":1747000,"to":1755000},"text":" El trabajo espiritual es despertar y tener una parte de uno que se separa de eso."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:29:15,000","to":"00:29:17,000"},"offsets":{"from":1755000,"to":1757000},"text":" Esa parte de uno es la espiritualidad."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:29:17,000","to":"00:29:21,000"},"offsets":{"from":1757000,"to":1761000},"text":" Cuando estamos, caemos en ese sueño y la inconsciencia, es todo corporeo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:29:21,000","to":"00:29:29,000"},"offsets":{"from":1761000,"to":1769000},"text":" Pero está ahí, o sea, esa luz de la conciencia, esa luz del recuerdo, esa luz del corazón, está ahí."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:29:30,000","to":"00:29:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":1770000,"to":1775000},"text":" Está dentro de nuestro, está esperando que nosotros trabajemos ahí, ¿sí?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:29:35,000","to":"00:29:45,000"},"offsets":{"from":1775000,"to":1785000},"text":" Entonces, no hay una disociación, no hay una disociación entre tu vida y tener un camino espiritual."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:29:45,000","to":"00:29:49,000"},"offsets":{"from":1785000,"to":1789000},"text":" Sino que vos tenés que tener tu vida, pero en bebida y en sentido."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:29:49,000","to":"00:29:52,000"},"offsets":{"from":1789000,"to":1792000},"text":" En bebida y en contenido."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:29:53,000","to":"00:30:01,000"},"offsets":{"from":1793000,"to":1801000},"text":" Vas a empezar a encontrar que cuando vos le das ese sentido, la realidad que..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:30:01,000","to":"00:30:05,000"},"offsets":{"from":1801000,"to":1805000},"text":" O sea, todo lo que te rodea, vas a empezar a leer cosas que antes no leías."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:30:05,000","to":"00:30:09,000"},"offsets":{"from":1805000,"to":1809000},"text":" Vas a empezar a encontrar cosas que antes no encontrabas."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:30:09,000","to":"00:30:16,000"},"offsets":{"from":1809000,"to":1816000},"text":" Vas a empezar, porque todo, Dios dice, todo lo que te va a suceder en la vida, lo voy a enviar yo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:30:16,000","to":"00:30:21,000"},"offsets":{"from":1816000,"to":1821000},"text":" Y no hay nada, no hay nada de lo que te suceda que no tengo enseñanza para vos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:30:22,000","to":"00:30:26,000"},"offsets":{"from":1822000,"to":1826000},"text":" O sea, cada cosa que te sucede en la vida, en tu vida, es de lo peor que te pasó,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:30:26,000","to":"00:30:30,000"},"offsets":{"from":1826000,"to":1830000},"text":" es decir, no, mira, esto es tremendo, vos lo sabes porque te pasó."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:30:30,000","to":"00:30:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":1830000,"to":1835000},"text":" Pero hay una enseñanza y un diseño perfecto que Dios hizo para vos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:30:35,000","to":"00:30:39,000"},"offsets":{"from":1835000,"to":1839000},"text":" Y todo lo que Él hizo para vos tiene ese sentido."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:30:39,000","to":"00:30:44,000"},"offsets":{"from":1839000,"to":1844000},"text":" De que te despiertes a descubrir que Él es el que te lo está dando, ¿sí?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:30:47,000","to":"00:30:55,000"},"offsets":{"from":1847000,"to":1855000},"text":" Es... O sea, eso es despertar el amor, es lo que decía el Chegueze,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:30:55,000","to":"00:31:02,000"},"offsets":{"from":1855000,"to":1862000},"text":" porque cuando vos descubras que estás en un océano de misericordia, es igual que los chicos,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:31:02,000","to":"00:31:06,000"},"offsets":{"from":1862000,"to":1866000},"text":" es igual que los chicos, los chicos no se dan cuenta que el papá está ahí,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:31:06,000","to":"00:31:12,000"},"offsets":{"from":1866000,"to":1872000},"text":" permanentemente cuidando, un padre ideal, pongámosle, no se dan cuenta."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:31:13,000","to":"00:31:17,000"},"offsets":{"from":1873000,"to":1877000},"text":" Yo me acuerdo de que estábamos con mi hijo, me acuerdo de escena patente,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:31:17,000","to":"00:31:23,000"},"offsets":{"from":1877000,"to":1883000},"text":" estaba mi hijo que tenía hace 4 o 5 años, estábamos en un campo y yo lo veo de lejos con mi esposa."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:31:23,000","to":"00:31:27,000"},"offsets":{"from":1883000,"to":1887000},"text":" Y estaba así, estaba así, jugando así, jugando."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:31:27,000","to":"00:31:33,000"},"offsets":{"from":1887000,"to":1893000},"text":" Y yo vi el cielo, vi el campo y dije, todo está ahí para él, no, todo está ahí para él."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:31:33,000","to":"00:31:41,000"},"offsets":{"from":1893000,"to":1901000},"text":" Y nosotros estábamos viéndolo a él y cuidándolo, sin que él tenga noción de nada, ¿no?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:31:43,000","to":"00:31:51,000"},"offsets":{"from":1903000,"to":1911000},"text":" Ahora, un padre, una madre va a darle algo al hijo que lo ama, que no es bueno para él, ¿no?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:31:51,000","to":"00:31:57,000"},"offsets":{"from":1911000,"to":1917000},"text":" Ahora, ¿qué hay? Bueno, estamos usando los arquetipos, digamos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:31:57,000","to":"00:32:02,000"},"offsets":{"from":1917000,"to":1922000},"text":" Ahora, ¿cuánto más el Señor de todos los mundos para cada uno de nosotros?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:32:02,000","to":"00:32:08,000"},"offsets":{"from":1922000,"to":1928000},"text":" No hay nada que él nos ponga en nuestro camino que no tenga un bien, que no encierra un bien."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:32:09,000","to":"00:32:14,000"},"offsets":{"from":1929000,"to":1934000},"text":" Dice, tal vez ustedes piensan que hay un mal en eso, pero es bueno para ustedes."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:32:14,000","to":"00:32:19,000"},"offsets":{"from":1934000,"to":1939000},"text":" Y tal vez ustedes piensan que hay un bien, pero es mal para ustedes."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:32:19,000","to":"00:32:28,000"},"offsets":{"from":1939000,"to":1948000},"text":" Entonces, cuando uno le pone esa luz del sentido y empieza a leer todo eso,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:32:28,000","to":"00:32:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":1948000,"to":1955000},"text":" y empieza a leer lo que ocurre en la vida de uno, empieza a descubrir el que está más allá de las circunstancias."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:32:36,000","to":"00:32:40,000"},"offsets":{"from":1956000,"to":1960000},"text":" ¿Sí? Y eso es lo que entendemos nosotros por despertar."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:32:40,000","to":"00:32:44,000"},"offsets":{"from":1960000,"to":1964000},"text":" Eso es lo que se llama despertar espiritual."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:32:44,000","to":"00:32:47,000"},"offsets":{"from":1964000,"to":1967000},"text":" Ahora esa parte, ¿cómo, con qué lo vamos a ver?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:32:47,000","to":"00:32:51,000"},"offsets":{"from":1967000,"to":1971000},"text":" Con parte de algo que me pasó ahora."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:32:51,000","to":"00:32:57,000"},"offsets":{"from":1971000,"to":1977000},"text":" Me fui a Bairroche, yo trabajo en tecnología, todo el tiempo tengo súper racional y demás,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:32:57,000","to":"00:33:03,000"},"offsets":{"from":1977000,"to":1983000},"text":" y me fui en VAL y él no tiene científicos y hace unas cosas increíbles."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:33:04,000","to":"00:33:11,000"},"offsets":{"from":1984000,"to":1991000},"text":" Cuando volví aca ayer, me pasó algo que es como si fuera como una endija que se abrió y no tenía explicación,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:33:11,000","to":"00:33:17,000"},"offsets":{"from":1991000,"to":1997000},"text":" pero que sé cómo sentir, valorar las arriesas, o si bien lo que también lo valoras,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:33:17,000","to":"00:33:22,000"},"offsets":{"from":1997000,"to":2002000},"text":" pero empecé a ver las sorpresas de una forma diferente, y un poco de contacto con otras personas en otro lugar,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:33:22,000","to":"00:33:27,000"},"offsets":{"from":2002000,"to":2007000},"text":" y con esta maravillada también con todo lo que me rodeaba, que antes no prestaba atención en ese presente."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:33:27,000","to":"00:33:33,000"},"offsets":{"from":2007000,"to":2013000},"text":" Y todas las palabras que decía de las primeras veces que vine acá a hoy,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:33:34,000","to":"00:33:39,000"},"offsets":{"from":2014000,"to":2019000},"text":" me platican de una forma más potente, es ponerlo en palabras,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:33:39,000","to":"00:33:46,000"},"offsets":{"from":2019000,"to":2026000},"text":" pero cuando estaba caminando y trataba de tensar y quería explicar esas emociones,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:33:46,000","to":"00:33:51,000"},"offsets":{"from":2026000,"to":2031000},"text":" no había forma de explicar, simplemente ir a sentirlas y se siente distinto,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:33:51,000","to":"00:33:54,000"},"offsets":{"from":2031000,"to":2034000},"text":" y como que miras el camino recorrido y no sabes dónde vas a ir,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:33:54,000","to":"00:33:59,000"},"offsets":{"from":2034000,"to":2039000},"text":" pero me parece un artenismo, el uso de la palabra para explicar algo que es intangible,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:33:59,000","to":"00:34:02,000"},"offsets":{"from":2039000,"to":2042000},"text":" que solamente se siente y bueno, se recorre."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:34:03,000","to":"00:34:11,000"},"offsets":{"from":2043000,"to":2051000},"text":" Entonces lo que me suje todo eso es la importancia de estar como en un presente intenso, pero simple,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:34:11,000","to":"00:34:21,000"},"offsets":{"from":2051000,"to":2061000},"text":" y gracias, porque no sé dónde está, pero es eso de transitar y como una insortidumbre."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:34:21,000","to":"00:34:30,000"},"offsets":{"from":2061000,"to":2070000},"text":" Totalmente, son las proturas espirituales, en la medida que no, o sea, despertar es eso,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:34:31,000","to":"00:34:38,000"},"offsets":{"from":2071000,"to":2078000},"text":" empezar a valorar todo eso, por eso el corán dice, los amigos de Dios no se entristecen por nada,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:34:38,000","to":"00:34:46,000"},"offsets":{"from":2078000,"to":2086000},"text":" o sea, nada de lo que pasó lo se entristece, nosotros siempre vivimos en ese pasado permanente que vuelve a nosotros,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:34:46,000","to":"00:34:54,000"},"offsets":{"from":2086000,"to":2094000},"text":" que nos persigue, pero que no existe, o sea, liberarse de eso, o sea, sacarse todos los pesos,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:34:54,000","to":"00:35:00,000"},"offsets":{"from":2094000,"to":2100000},"text":" es lo que decía ella, empezar a estar livianos, los pesos son de nuestro ego."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:35:01,000","to":"00:35:07,000"},"offsets":{"from":2101000,"to":2107000},"text":" Entonces, los amigos de Dios no se entristecen y tampoco se preocupan por lo que va a venir,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:35:07,000","to":"00:35:12,000"},"offsets":{"from":2107000,"to":2112000},"text":" o sea, no se preocupan por el futuro ni se entristecen por el pasado, están en ese presente."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:35:12,000","to":"00:35:22,000"},"offsets":{"from":2112000,"to":2122000},"text":" En ese presente, podemos acercarnos a esa presencia divina, en esa simpleza,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:35:22,000","to":"00:35:29,000"},"offsets":{"from":2122000,"to":2129000},"text":" en eso sentir nuestra dependencia absoluta y agradecer lo que tenemos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:35:30,000","to":"00:35:37,000"},"offsets":{"from":2130000,"to":2137000},"text":" Estamos rodeados de gracias, o sea, ahora estamos todos bien, ninguno de nosotros o alguien le molesta algo,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:35:37,000","to":"00:35:44,000"},"offsets":{"from":2137000,"to":2144000},"text":" pero estamos bien, ahora vivimos inmersos en un estado de bendición,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:35:44,000","to":"00:35:51,000"},"offsets":{"from":2144000,"to":2151000},"text":" pero no lo veremos porque estamos preocupados con esa cabeza, con esos pensamientos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:35:51,000","to":"00:35:59,000"},"offsets":{"from":2151000,"to":2159000},"text":" Entonces, la posibilidad de despertar a ese regalo que es la vida misma,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:36:00,000","to":"00:36:04,000"},"offsets":{"from":2160000,"to":2164000},"text":" es lo que Dios dice, le di la capacidad de ver, le di la capacidad de escuchar"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:36:04,000","to":"00:36:10,000"},"offsets":{"from":2164000,"to":2170000},"text":" y leí lo más importante, un corazón, una conciencia para poder leer todos los signos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:36:10,000","to":"00:36:18,000"},"offsets":{"from":2170000,"to":2178000},"text":" Agradezcan, entonces, eso es el eje del camino."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:36:18,000","to":"00:36:24,000"},"offsets":{"from":2178000,"to":2184000},"text":" Y ahí empiezan los desafíos y ahí empiezan las pruebas, porque ahora estamos todos sentados,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:36:25,000","to":"00:36:30,000"},"offsets":{"from":2185000,"to":2190000},"text":" pero después el desafío es llevar eso a la diaria."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:36:30,000","to":"00:36:37,000"},"offsets":{"from":2190000,"to":2197000},"text":" Ese es el desafío, es lograr ese lugar interior, que en mi caso lo digo, pero no lo tengo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:36:37,000","to":"00:36:41,000"},"offsets":{"from":2197000,"to":2201000},"text":" O sea, es una lucha, ahí está lo que se llama el esfuerzo, la lucha espiritual."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:36:41,000","to":"00:36:48,000"},"offsets":{"from":2201000,"to":2208000},"text":" La lucha espiritual es empezar a dejar el yo ir hacia Dios."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:36:49,000","to":"00:36:57,000"},"offsets":{"from":2209000,"to":2217000},"text":" Y esto es así, mientras más nos voltimos, Abraham que dijo, me vuelvo con todo mi ser hacia Dios."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:36:57,000","to":"00:37:01,000"},"offsets":{"from":2217000,"to":2221000},"text":" Cuando nos ocupamos de Dios, nos liberamos de nuestro ego."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:37:01,000","to":"00:37:07,000"},"offsets":{"from":2221000,"to":2227000},"text":" Cuando nos ocupamos de ver ese presente, esas gracias, nos alivianamos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:37:07,000","to":"00:37:12,000"},"offsets":{"from":2227000,"to":2232000},"text":" Ahora, cuando nos orientamos hacia esas estrellas que se desvanecen,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:37:13,000","to":"00:37:22,000"},"offsets":{"from":2233000,"to":2242000},"text":" nuestros pensamientos, nuestras opiniones, nuestros problemas, nuestro pasado, nuestras quejas, nuestras críticas,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:37:22,000","to":"00:37:27,000"},"offsets":{"from":2242000,"to":2247000},"text":" empezamos a hundir nuestra alma en un peso que lo oprime."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:37:27,000","to":"00:37:32,000"},"offsets":{"from":2247000,"to":2252000},"text":" O sea, si nos acercamos a Dios, nos alejamos a nuestro ego."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:37:32,000","to":"00:37:36,000"},"offsets":{"from":2252000,"to":2256000},"text":" Y si nos acercamos a nuestro ego, nos alejamos a Dios."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:37:36,000","to":"00:37:40,000"},"offsets":{"from":2256000,"to":2260000},"text":" Son todas formas de ver en un mundo físico algo que es la realidad espiritual"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:37:41,000","to":"00:37:43,000"},"offsets":{"from":2261000,"to":2263000},"text":" y que cada uno tiene que verlo de una manera distinta."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:37:43,000","to":"00:37:48,000"},"offsets":{"from":2263000,"to":2268000},"text":" O sea, la relación personal con Dios es única para cada uno de nosotros."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:37:48,000","to":"00:37:51,000"},"offsets":{"from":2268000,"to":2271000},"text":" Pero esa es la maravilla de este mundo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:37:51,000","to":"00:37:57,000"},"offsets":{"from":2271000,"to":2277000},"text":" Por eso, cuando ella está acondiendo su experiencia, me acordé de una frase del profeta en la Paz y las Veniciones,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:37:57,000","to":"00:38:03,000"},"offsets":{"from":2277000,"to":2283000},"text":" que dijo que maravillosos, que asombrosos son los asuntos del que tiene esa vida en el corazón."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:38:03,000","to":"00:38:10,000"},"offsets":{"from":2283000,"to":2290000},"text":" Porque en todo encuentra buenas cosas, en todo encuentra maravillas, se sorprende todo el tiempo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:38:11,000","to":"00:38:21,000"},"offsets":{"from":2291000,"to":2301000},"text":" Si le viene algo malo, espera, mantiene la calma, no se vuelve loco, es paciente, espera."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:38:21,000","to":"00:38:24,000"},"offsets":{"from":2301000,"to":2304000},"text":" Y en el de venir se convierte en algo bueno."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:38:24,000","to":"00:38:29,000"},"offsets":{"from":2304000,"to":2309000},"text":" Y si le viene algo bueno, agradece."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:38:29,000","to":"00:38:34,000"},"offsets":{"from":2309000,"to":2314000},"text":" Y todos sus asuntos son maravillosos y benditos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:38:34,000","to":"00:38:38,000"},"offsets":{"from":2314000,"to":2318000},"text":" Entonces, eso es un poco lo que buscamos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:38:42,000","to":"00:38:44,000"},"offsets":{"from":2322000,"to":2324000},"text":" Bueno, ya estamos, ¿no?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:38:44,000","to":"00:38:46,000"},"offsets":{"from":2324000,"to":2326000},"text":" ¿Cuánto vas?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:38:46,000","to":"00:38:55,000"},"offsets":{"from":2326000,"to":2335000},"text":" Vamos a hacer un dica, una meditación, Sufi."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:38:55,000","to":"00:38:58,000"},"offsets":{"from":2335000,"to":2338000},"text":" ¿Una otra pregunta?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:38:58,000","to":"00:39:02,000"},"offsets":{"from":2338000,"to":2342000},"text":" Sí, te dijiste que..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:39:02,000","to":"00:39:09,000"},"offsets":{"from":2342000,"to":2349000},"text":" Llegaste espiritual previo, que veníamos de ahí."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:39:10,000","to":"00:39:11,000"},"offsets":{"from":2350000,"to":2351000},"text":" ¿Quién lo dijo?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:39:11,000","to":"00:39:22,000"},"offsets":{"from":2351000,"to":2362000},"text":" Bueno, en mi corán se describe la estación previa a la existencia."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:39:22,000","to":"00:39:27,000"},"offsets":{"from":2362000,"to":2367000},"text":" La creación de las almas, todo el tiempo hablamos del corazón, ¿no?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:39:27,000","to":"00:39:29,000"},"offsets":{"from":2367000,"to":2369000},"text":" Pero ahora..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:39:34,000","to":"00:39:42,000"},"offsets":{"from":2374000,"to":2382000},"text":" Esto es muy interesante, en un momento, en la vida del profeta, a la paz y las venencias se hacían con él,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:39:42,000","to":"00:39:47,000"},"offsets":{"from":2382000,"to":2387000},"text":" que estuvo en contacto con judíos, ¿sí?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:39:47,000","to":"00:39:52,000"},"offsets":{"from":2387000,"to":2392000},"text":" Y entonces, unos rabinos quisieron poner las pruebas para ver si realmente era un profeta."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:39:52,000","to":"00:39:58,000"},"offsets":{"from":2392000,"to":2398000},"text":" O sea, eruditos del estudio, de la Torah."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:39:58,000","to":"00:40:00,000"},"offsets":{"from":2398000,"to":2400000},"text":" Entonces, le fueron con tres preguntas."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:40:01,000","to":"00:40:07,000"},"offsets":{"from":2401000,"to":2407000},"text":" Una de las preguntas era sobre el alma, que hable sobre el alma."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:40:07,000","to":"00:40:12,000"},"offsets":{"from":2407000,"to":2412000},"text":" Entonces, el profeta, la paz y las venencias, lo hablaba por sí mismo, hablaba por inspiración, ¿no?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:40:12,000","to":"00:40:18,000"},"offsets":{"from":2412000,"to":2418000},"text":" Entonces, cuando le llega la respuesta, dice,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:40:18,000","to":"00:40:25,000"},"offsets":{"from":2418000,"to":2425000},"text":" \\"No se les ha dado conocimiento acerca de ello, y lo que posee de conocimiento es muy pequeño\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:40:26,000","to":"00:40:31,000"},"offsets":{"from":2426000,"to":2431000},"text":" Y eso es algo inmenso, porque el alma es eterna."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:40:31,000","to":"00:40:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":2431000,"to":2435000},"text":" Esa parte real nuestra es eterna."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:40:35,000","to":"00:40:41,000"},"offsets":{"from":2435000,"to":2441000},"text":" Y la eternidad no se puede entender con la cabeza."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:40:41,000","to":"00:40:50,000"},"offsets":{"from":2441000,"to":2450000},"text":" Entonces, cada uno de nosotros tiene algo que es inconmensurablemente valioso,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:40:51,000","to":"00:40:58,000"},"offsets":{"from":2451000,"to":2458000},"text":" que no tiene fin, y que surge, que fue insuflado por Dios, dice Dios."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:40:58,000","to":"00:41:02,000"},"offsets":{"from":2458000,"to":2462000},"text":" Y yo, de mi espíritu, lo puse en ustedes."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:41:02,000","to":"00:41:07,000"},"offsets":{"from":2462000,"to":2467000},"text":" Ese es el misterio más grande, que es inalcanzable,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:41:07,000","to":"00:41:13,000"},"offsets":{"from":2467000,"to":2473000},"text":" y cada uno tiene que sondear en el océano de su corazón para escudir, ¿no?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:41:13,000","to":"00:41:18,000"},"offsets":{"from":2473000,"to":2478000},"text":" Entonces, en la pre-eternidad, antes de que exista nada,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:41:19,000","to":"00:41:25,000"},"offsets":{"from":2479000,"to":2485000},"text":" todas esas almas, o sea, cada uno de nosotros, estábamos en la presencia divina."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:41:25,000","to":"00:41:30,000"},"offsets":{"from":2485000,"to":2490000},"text":" Sin forma, sin espacio, inentendible para nuestros intelectos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:41:30,000","to":"00:41:37,000"},"offsets":{"from":2490000,"to":2497000},"text":" Y Dios nos pregunta y nos dice, \\"No soy yo el que los creo\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:41:37,000","to":"00:41:43,000"},"offsets":{"from":2497000,"to":2503000},"text":" Sin forma, sin tiempo, sin sonido, uno tiene que entender esto."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:41:44,000","to":"00:41:52,000"},"offsets":{"from":2504000,"to":2512000},"text":" No soy yo el que les da amor, no soy yo el que los sostengo, no soy yo,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:41:52,000","to":"00:41:59,000"},"offsets":{"from":2512000,"to":2519000},"text":" porque yo era un tesoro oculto, dice Dios, y quise ser conocido."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:41:59,000","to":"00:42:04,000"},"offsets":{"from":2519000,"to":2524000},"text":" O sea, quise manifestar ese misericordio, ese amor sin fin,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:42:04,000","to":"00:42:08,000"},"offsets":{"from":2524000,"to":2528000},"text":" y los crea a ustedes para que me conozcan."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:42:09,000","to":"00:42:15,000"},"offsets":{"from":2529000,"to":2535000},"text":" Y todas las almas, o sea, todos nosotros respondimos, \\"Sí, lo eres\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:42:15,000","to":"00:42:22,000"},"offsets":{"from":2535000,"to":2542000},"text":" Entonces, esa alma, después, entra a este cuerpo que tenemos ahora,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:42:22,000","to":"00:42:29,000"},"offsets":{"from":2542000,"to":2549000},"text":" y lo que tenemos, esa promesa, ese estado, o sea, se confirma acá."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:42:29,000","to":"00:42:32,000"},"offsets":{"from":2549000,"to":2552000},"text":" En esta vida tenemos que confirmar eso."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:42:33,000","to":"00:42:39,000"},"offsets":{"from":2553000,"to":2559000},"text":" Es decir, \\"Sí, tú eres mi Señor, tú eres la fuente que me sostiene,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:42:39,000","to":"00:42:44,000"},"offsets":{"from":2559000,"to":2564000},"text":" la fuente de toda la misericordia\\", o sea, descubrir ese océgano de misericordia en el que estamos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:42:44,000","to":"00:42:47,000"},"offsets":{"from":2564000,"to":2567000},"text":" Y ahí confirmar eso que dijimos allá."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:42:47,000","to":"00:42:51,000"},"offsets":{"from":2567000,"to":2571000},"text":" Entonces, es eso, de ahí viene."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:42:51,000","to":"00:42:54,000"},"offsets":{"from":2571000,"to":2574000},"text":" - ¿De ahí? - Sí, de ahí."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:43:03,000","to":"00:43:08,000"},"offsets":{"from":2583000,"to":2588000},"text":" - Gracias. - Gracias."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:43:08,000","to":"00:43:30,000"},"offsets":{"from":2588000,"to":2610000},"text":" - ¿Alguna otra pregunta? - Sí."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:43:31,000","to":"00:43:37,000"},"offsets":{"from":2611000,"to":2617000},"text":" - ¿Por qué le dices una pregunta? - Aquí me voy a preguntar a la profeta de la Paz de las Vendiciones."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:43:37,000","to":"00:43:44,000"},"offsets":{"from":2617000,"to":2624000},"text":" Le preguntaron por Dulcor Nain, se llama \\"el de los dos cuarnos\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:43:44,000","to":"00:43:50,000"},"offsets":{"from":2624000,"to":2630000},"text":" Es como una persona, uno dice que era un profeta, otro dice que era Alejandro del Magno."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:43:50,000","to":"00:43:55,000"},"offsets":{"from":2630000,"to":2635000},"text":" Le vino la revelación de Dulcor Nain."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:43:55,000","to":"00:44:00,000"},"offsets":{"from":2635000,"to":2640000},"text":" - ¿Eso es el que me daba? - No."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:44:01,000","to":"00:44:03,000"},"offsets":{"from":2641000,"to":2643000},"text":" Entonces la elegí."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:44:03,000","to":"00:44:09,000"},"offsets":{"from":2643000,"to":2649000},"text":" Le preguntaron a Dulcor Nain, el alma, y de los Dormentes de la Cabarna."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:44:09,000","to":"00:44:14,000"},"offsets":{"from":2649000,"to":2654000},"text":" Dormentes de la Cabarna eran cristianos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:44:14,000","to":"00:44:22,000"},"offsets":{"from":2654000,"to":2662000},"text":" No, ahí están en distintos lugares, están en Turquía."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:44:22,000","to":"00:44:29,000"},"offsets":{"from":2662000,"to":2669000},"text":" Los Dormientes de la Cabarna eran unos chicos, unos cristianos que vivían en el tiempo como un rey opresor."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:44:30,000","to":"00:44:34,000"},"offsets":{"from":2670000,"to":2674000},"text":" Y Dios los sostiene en una cabarna, ese es un milagro, está en el cristianismo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:44:34,000","to":"00:44:38,000"},"offsets":{"from":2674000,"to":2678000},"text":" Es un lugar de perinación de los cristianos y los musulmanes, está en Turquía."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:44:38,000","to":"00:44:45,000"},"offsets":{"from":2678000,"to":2685000},"text":" Entonces se hace como un milagro que Dios los sostiene durmiendo pero vivos, más de 300 años."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:44:45,000","to":"00:44:51,000"},"offsets":{"from":2685000,"to":2691000},"text":" Y se convierte en un milagro. Entonces le preguntan sobre los Dormientes y les contestan."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:44:51,000","to":"00:44:57,000"},"offsets":{"from":2691000,"to":2697000},"text":" Son cosas difíciles que no había en información, porque nadie salía cuántos eran."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:44:58,000","to":"00:45:03,000"},"offsets":{"from":2698000,"to":2703000},"text":" Entonces revela eso y Dulcor Nain, este personaje tampoco se conocía quién era."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:45:03,000","to":"00:45:08,000"},"offsets":{"from":2703000,"to":2708000},"text":" También reveló sobre eso, les contestó sobre eso, y sobre el alma, vino esa respuesta."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:45:08,000","to":"00:45:17,000"},"offsets":{"from":2708000,"to":2717000},"text":" Bueno, en el Sur a Turcaf, en la Sur a la Cabarna están los Dormientes."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:45:17,000","to":"00:45:20,000"},"offsets":{"from":2717000,"to":2720000},"text":" Y también está ahí Dulcor Nain, no parece."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:45:20,000","to":"00:45:24,000"},"offsets":{"from":2720000,"to":2724000},"text":" La de estar en las dos Sur a la Cabarna."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:45:28,000","to":"00:45:31,000"},"offsets":{"from":2728000,"to":2731000},"text":" Sí, está bien comparado. Y yo también estoy haciendo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:45:31,000","to":"00:45:33,000"},"offsets":{"from":2731000,"to":2733000},"text":" Con los dos Sur."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:45:33,000","to":"00:45:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":2733000,"to":2735000},"text":" Bueno."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:45:35,000","to":"00:45:40,000"},"offsets":{"from":2735000,"to":2740000},"text":" Los chicos, ¿qué pasó?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:45:40,000","to":"00:45:45,000"},"offsets":{"from":2740000,"to":2745000},"text":" ¿Quién se le fue la..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:45:45,000","to":"00:45:47,000"},"offsets":{"from":2745000,"to":2747000},"text":" ¿Quién se le fue un mojazo?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:45:47,000","to":"00:45:48,000"},"offsets":{"from":2747000,"to":2748000},"text":" Sí."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:45:54,000","to":"00:45:58,000"},"offsets":{"from":2754000,"to":2758000},"text":" ¿Me hablas hecho de una parte del desierto? ¿Son los coptos?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:45:58,000","to":"00:46:00,000"},"offsets":{"from":2758000,"to":2760000},"text":" No, son antes los coptos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:46:00,000","to":"00:46:06,000"},"offsets":{"from":2760000,"to":2766000},"text":" Habían coptos también, pero los parades ciertos eran ortodoxos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:46:06,000","to":"00:46:10,000"},"offsets":{"from":2766000,"to":2770000},"text":" Tenían un sistema, los parades ciertos tenían un sistema muy interesante,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:46:10,000","to":"00:46:15,000"},"offsets":{"from":2770000,"to":2775000},"text":" que es también en el sufismo lo que se busca la ración permanente del corazón."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:46:15,000","to":"00:46:20,000"},"offsets":{"from":2775000,"to":2780000},"text":" O sea, esa parte espiritual puede entrar en un estado de conciencia permanente,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:46:20,000","to":"00:46:22,000"},"offsets":{"from":2780000,"to":2782000},"text":" que es el recuerdo permanente."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:46:23,000","to":"00:46:26,000"},"offsets":{"from":2783000,"to":2786000},"text":" Uno, cuando tiene esto, por ejemplo, dice \\"Allah\\","},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:46:26,000","to":"00:46:28,000"},"offsets":{"from":2786000,"to":2788000},"text":" \\"Allah\\" con la lengua."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:46:28,000","to":"00:46:31,000"},"offsets":{"from":2788000,"to":2791000},"text":" ¿Sí? \\"Allah\\" es Dios, ¿sí?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:46:31,000","to":"00:46:37,000"},"offsets":{"from":2791000,"to":2797000},"text":" Entonces, cuando uno lo dice con la lengua,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:46:37,000","to":"00:46:41,000"},"offsets":{"from":2797000,"to":2801000},"text":" en la medida que ese significado empieza a tener,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:46:41,000","to":"00:46:47,000"},"offsets":{"from":2801000,"to":2807000},"text":" o sea, esa palabra tiene significado, se toma significado,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:46:47,000","to":"00:46:51,000"},"offsets":{"from":2807000,"to":2811000},"text":" esa pronunciación con la lengua baja el corazón."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:46:52,000","to":"00:46:54,000"},"offsets":{"from":2812000,"to":2814000},"text":" Y empieza a sentirlo en el corazón."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:46:54,000","to":"00:47:01,000"},"offsets":{"from":2814000,"to":2821000},"text":" Y hay un momento que ese corazón espiritual, esa alma despierta y tiene vida propia."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:47:01,000","to":"00:47:08,000"},"offsets":{"from":2821000,"to":2828000},"text":" Entonces, uno puede tener una vida material y el espíritu se mueve interiormente mal independiente."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:47:08,000","to":"00:47:13,000"},"offsets":{"from":2828000,"to":2833000},"text":" Entonces, eso en el camino de los padres."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:47:13,000","to":"00:47:19,000"},"offsets":{"from":2833000,"to":2839000},"text":" El sitio se llama \\"Shiasam\\", en el sufismo se llama \\"Dhikrullah\\", el recuerdo de Dios."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:47:20,000","to":"00:47:25,000"},"offsets":{"from":2840000,"to":2845000},"text":" Entonces, no lo puedes alcanzar por vos mismo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:47:25,000","to":"00:47:29,000"},"offsets":{"from":2845000,"to":2849000},"text":" No se logra, o sea, uno se fuerza, pero es un regalo de Dios."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:47:29,000","to":"00:47:31,000"},"offsets":{"from":2849000,"to":2851000},"text":" Uno se fuerza, pero es un regalo de Dios."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:47:31,000","to":"00:47:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":2851000,"to":2855000},"text":" Y generalmente uno lo toma de alguien que lo tiene."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:47:35,000","to":"00:47:37,000"},"offsets":{"from":2855000,"to":2857000},"text":" De alguien que lo tiene."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:47:37,000","to":"00:47:39,000"},"offsets":{"from":2857000,"to":2859000},"text":" Por eso nuestro camino es muy importante el guía espiritual,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:47:39,000","to":"00:47:42,000"},"offsets":{"from":2859000,"to":2862000},"text":" porque te va guiando para que se abra eso, ¿sí?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:47:42,000","to":"00:47:46,000"},"offsets":{"from":2862000,"to":2866000},"text":" Cuando se abre eso, ese estado de conciencia, ese estado de presencia,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:47:47,000","to":"00:47:53,000"},"offsets":{"from":2867000,"to":2873000},"text":" es el estado de presencia, de conciencia, donde no hay nada."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:47:53,000","to":"00:47:57,000"},"offsets":{"from":2873000,"to":2877000},"text":" Es la previa para empezar a tener ese rezo permanente, ¿no?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:47:57,000","to":"00:48:02,000"},"offsets":{"from":2877000,"to":2882000},"text":" Entonces, nosotros cuando hacemos el \\"Dhikr\\", lo que se llama el recuerdo de Dios,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:48:02,000","to":"00:48:07,000"},"offsets":{"from":2882000,"to":2887000},"text":" lo que buscamos, por ejemplo, cuando decimos \\"Allah\\", tratamos de que el nombre vaya al corazón."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:48:07,000","to":"00:48:13,000"},"offsets":{"from":2887000,"to":2893000},"text":" O cuando decimos \\"La\\" y \\"Laja\\", se acuerdan, se había explicado esto que no existe nada."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:48:14,000","to":"00:48:21,000"},"offsets":{"from":2894000,"to":2901000},"text":" O sea, negar todo, o sea, limpiar el corazón y la \\"Allah\\" excepto Dios."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:48:21,000","to":"00:48:25,000"},"offsets":{"from":2901000,"to":2905000},"text":" Y uno busca que eso resuene, que golpee el corazón."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:48:25,000","to":"00:48:29,000"},"offsets":{"from":2905000,"to":2909000},"text":" Entonces, no está bien echar el nombre de Dios, pero sería decir cuando digo \\"Allah\\","},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:48:29,000","to":"00:48:32,000"},"offsets":{"from":2909000,"to":2912000},"text":" y yo digo de \\"Galema el corazón\\" o \\"El corazón le abre el corazón\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:48:32,000","to":"00:48:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":2912000,"to":2915000},"text":" No, uno lo dice, tampoco es..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:48:35,000","to":"00:48:40,000"},"offsets":{"from":2915000,"to":2920000},"text":" No tiene que hacerse, uno tiene que hacerlo el corazón."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:48:41,000","to":"00:48:44,000"},"offsets":{"from":2921000,"to":2924000},"text":" Por eso también es la pregunta más, vamos a ir con inventación,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:48:44,000","to":"00:48:49,000"},"offsets":{"from":2924000,"to":2929000},"text":" cuando conciera un \\"Dhikr\\" de \\"El corazón\\" para la lengua o la lengua para el corazón."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:48:49,000","to":"00:48:51,000"},"offsets":{"from":2929000,"to":2931000},"text":" ¿Y ahora cómo lo decís?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:48:51,000","to":"00:48:53,000"},"offsets":{"from":2931000,"to":2933000},"text":" ¿Y ahora cómo lo decís?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:48:53,000","to":"00:48:55,000"},"offsets":{"from":2933000,"to":2935000},"text":" Pero por eso, esto es..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:48:55,000","to":"00:48:59,000"},"offsets":{"from":2935000,"to":2939000},"text":" O sea, cuando uno entra en ese mundo, en los pensamientos, es otra dimensión,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:48:59,000","to":"00:49:01,000"},"offsets":{"from":2939000,"to":2941000},"text":" la dimensión espiritual es otro lugar."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:49:01,000","to":"00:49:04,000"},"offsets":{"from":2941000,"to":2944000},"text":" Está como que la \\"Dhikr\\", la \\"Dhikr\\", la \\"Dhikr\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:49:04,000","to":"00:49:07,000"},"offsets":{"from":2944000,"to":2947000},"text":" Exactamente, son dos mares."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:49:08,000","to":"00:49:11,000"},"offsets":{"from":2948000,"to":2951000},"text":" Uno de los miragros, dicen que el Yag custose y la misó por eso."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:49:11,000","to":"00:49:15,000"},"offsets":{"from":2951000,"to":2955000},"text":" Dice, \\"Hay dos océanos y no se juntan\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:49:15,000","to":"00:49:17,000"},"offsets":{"from":2955000,"to":2957000},"text":" Eso se descubrió en 1940, 1950."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:49:17,000","to":"00:49:20,000"},"offsets":{"from":2957000,"to":2960000},"text":" La diferencia de densidad y salidad es \\"no se mezcla\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:49:20,000","to":"00:49:23,000"},"offsets":{"from":2960000,"to":2963000},"text":" Esto está hace mil cuatrocientos años en el Corán."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:49:23,000","to":"00:49:25,000"},"offsets":{"from":2963000,"to":2965000},"text":" Los océanos no se mezclan."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:49:25,000","to":"00:49:28,000"},"offsets":{"from":2965000,"to":2968000},"text":" O sea, uno, hay una línea que va hasta abajo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:49:28,000","to":"00:49:31,000"},"offsets":{"from":2968000,"to":2971000},"text":" Bueno, acá en el Río El Prato se ve."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:49:31,000","to":"00:49:36,000"},"offsets":{"from":2971000,"to":2976000},"text":" Entonces, eso es el mundo físico, el mundo espiritual lo mismo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:49:37,000","to":"00:49:41,000"},"offsets":{"from":2977000,"to":2981000},"text":" La espiritualidad es otra dimensión, a la que uno tiene que entrar."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:49:41,000","to":"00:49:47,000"},"offsets":{"from":2981000,"to":2987000},"text":" ¿Cómo se entra a esa dimensión en el estado de \\"yo no sé nada\\"?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:49:47,000","to":"00:49:50,000"},"offsets":{"from":2987000,"to":2990000},"text":" No sé nada."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:49:50,000","to":"00:49:54,000"},"offsets":{"from":2990000,"to":2994000},"text":" Uno tiene que despojarse y hacerse vaciarse interiormente."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:49:54,000","to":"00:49:56,000"},"offsets":{"from":2994000,"to":2996000},"text":" Eso es la y la ja."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:49:56,000","to":"00:50:00,000"},"offsets":{"from":2996000,"to":3000000},"text":" Es decir, no soy, no sé, no puedo, no creo..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:50:00,000","to":"00:50:04,000"},"offsets":{"from":3000000,"to":3004000},"text":" Porque estamos tan cargados de opiniones y sensaciones de ser,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:50:04,000","to":"00:50:06,000"},"offsets":{"from":3004000,"to":3006000},"text":" pero es un falso ser."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:50:07,000","to":"00:50:09,000"},"offsets":{"from":3007000,"to":3009000},"text":" Porque es temporal, ¿sí?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:50:09,000","to":"00:50:13,000"},"offsets":{"from":3009000,"to":3013000},"text":" Bueno..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:50:13,000","to":"00:50:21,000"},"offsets":{"from":3013000,"to":3021000},"text":" Bueno, vamos a hacer, ¿quieren hacer una meditación?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:50:21,000","to":"00:50:23,000"},"offsets":{"from":3021000,"to":3023000},"text":" ¿O qué quieren hacer? ¿Hacemos \\"Dicar\\"?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:50:23,000","to":"00:50:26,000"},"offsets":{"from":3023000,"to":3026000},"text":" ¿Lanzas indias? ¿Qué hacemos?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:50:26,000","to":"00:50:28,000"},"offsets":{"from":3026000,"to":3028000},"text":" [risas]"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:50:28,000","to":"00:50:33,000"},"offsets":{"from":3028000,"to":3033000},"text":" Porque esta es la reunión de la iniciativa."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:50:33,000","to":"00:50:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":3033000,"to":3035000},"text":" Bueno, bueno, bueno."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:50:36,000","to":"00:50:37,000"},"offsets":{"from":3036000,"to":3037000},"text":" [inaudible]"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:50:37,000","to":"00:50:40,000"},"offsets":{"from":3037000,"to":3040000},"text":" Bueno, giramos porque todo gira."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:50:40,000","to":"00:50:43,000"},"offsets":{"from":3040000,"to":3043000},"text":" Eso es una inspiración, o sea, es una forma..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:50:43,000","to":"00:50:46,000"},"offsets":{"from":3043000,"to":3046000},"text":" O sea, el giro es el movimiento eterno."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:50:46,000","to":"00:50:49,000"},"offsets":{"from":3046000,"to":3049000},"text":" No tiene principio, no tiene fin."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:50:49,000","to":"00:50:52,000"},"offsets":{"from":3049000,"to":3052000},"text":" Es muy interesante el giro, porque vos..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:50:52,000","to":"00:50:59,000"},"offsets":{"from":3052000,"to":3059000},"text":" Por física, a medida que te aleja el centro, el movimiento es más rápido."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:50:59,000","to":"00:51:02,000"},"offsets":{"from":3059000,"to":3062000},"text":" Pero en el centro mismo, el giro no hay movimiento."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:51:02,000","to":"00:51:04,000"},"offsets":{"from":3062000,"to":3064000},"text":" ¿Sí?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:51:05,000","to":"00:51:06,000"},"offsets":{"from":3065000,"to":3066000},"text":" El giro tiene que ver con eso."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:51:06,000","to":"00:51:09,000"},"offsets":{"from":3066000,"to":3069000},"text":" El giro es el movimiento eterno, ¿no?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:51:09,000","to":"00:51:15,000"},"offsets":{"from":3069000,"to":3075000},"text":" Entonces uno gira buscando ese punto donde no hay movimiento."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:51:15,000","to":"00:51:17,000"},"offsets":{"from":3075000,"to":3077000},"text":" O sea, ese punto de la eternidad absoluta."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:51:17,000","to":"00:51:23,000"},"offsets":{"from":3077000,"to":3083000},"text":" Entonces todo gira, pero interiormente está ese punto eterno que tú."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:51:23,000","to":"00:51:25,000"},"offsets":{"from":3083000,"to":3085000},"text":" Y todo gira, todo está girando."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:51:25,000","to":"00:51:27,000"},"offsets":{"from":3085000,"to":3087000},"text":" Los átomos giran, todo está en ese movimiento."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:51:27,000","to":"00:51:29,000"},"offsets":{"from":3087000,"to":3089000},"text":" Todos los planetas giran."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:51:29,000","to":"00:51:32,000"},"offsets":{"from":3089000,"to":3092000},"text":" Nuestro sistema solar gira, nuestra galaxia gira,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:51:33,000","to":"00:51:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":3093000,"to":3095000},"text":" nuestro sistema... Todos están girando."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:51:35,000","to":"00:51:38,000"},"offsets":{"from":3095000,"to":3098000},"text":" Ahora estamos viajándose a un millón de kilómetros por hora."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:51:38,000","to":"00:51:42,000"},"offsets":{"from":3098000,"to":3102000},"text":" Ni nos damos cuenta, pero todo está girando y todo está en ese movimiento, ¿no?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:51:42,000","to":"00:51:48,000"},"offsets":{"from":3102000,"to":3108000},"text":" Pero hay algo que está fuera de ese movimiento, que es el creador del movimiento."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:51:48,000","to":"00:51:51,000"},"offsets":{"from":3108000,"to":3111000},"text":" Creó el movimiento, pero el movimiento no lo toma."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:51:51,000","to":"00:51:54,000"},"offsets":{"from":3111000,"to":3114000},"text":" Creó el tiempo, pero le está fuera del tiempo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:51:54,000","to":"00:52:01,000"},"offsets":{"from":3114000,"to":3121000},"text":" Creó el espacio, pero el espacio no lo contiene, excepto que el corazón de cada uno de nosotros."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:52:02,000","to":"00:52:03,000"},"offsets":{"from":3122000,"to":3123000},"text":" Y eso es el sentido de la vida."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:52:03,000","to":"00:52:08,000"},"offsets":{"from":3123000,"to":3128000},"text":" Si descubris eso, empezás a vivir."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:52:08,000","to":"00:52:15,000"},"offsets":{"from":3128000,"to":3135000},"text":" Puedes pasar toda tu vida y si no se abre eso, no voy a juzgar a nadie, ¿no?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:52:15,000","to":"00:52:17,000"},"offsets":{"from":3135000,"to":3137000},"text":" Porque no estamos todos en la misma."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:52:17,000","to":"00:52:23,000"},"offsets":{"from":3137000,"to":3143000},"text":" Pero si no se abre eso tan sublime, tan inmenso que tenés en tu corazón,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:52:23,000","to":"00:52:26,000"},"offsets":{"from":3143000,"to":3146000},"text":" que es un océano y el océano de poder conocer a Dios,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:52:26,000","to":"00:52:31,000"},"offsets":{"from":3146000,"to":3151000},"text":" de conocer esa gracia inmensa, si no los vivís en toda tu vida,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:52:32,000","to":"00:52:35,000"},"offsets":{"from":3152000,"to":3155000},"text":" no vas a ser común a esos que levantó la mano y dijo, \\"Yo no lo conocí\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:52:35,000","to":"00:52:41,000"},"offsets":{"from":3155000,"to":3161000},"text":" Eso para el sufismo, el sentido de la vida."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:52:41,000","to":"00:52:47,000"},"offsets":{"from":3161000,"to":3167000},"text":" Bueno, vamos a hacer..."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:52:47,000","to":"00:52:58,000"},"offsets":{"from":3167000,"to":3178000},"text":" Bueno, entonces la idea es hacer la... vamos a hacer el \\"dicar\\", ¿quieres?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:52:58,000","to":"00:53:01,000"},"offsets":{"from":3178000,"to":3181000},"text":" Hacemos un poquito una meditación para frenar la mente, un poquito."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:53:02,000","to":"00:53:04,000"},"offsets":{"from":3182000,"to":3184000},"text":" Y hacemos el \\"dicar\\" un \\"la\\", el recuerdo de Dios."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:53:04,000","to":"00:53:07,000"},"offsets":{"from":3184000,"to":3187000},"text":" Hacemos al \\"la\\", ¿les parece?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:53:07,000","to":"00:53:11,000"},"offsets":{"from":3187000,"to":3191000},"text":" La y la \\"ja\\" y la \\"la\\" les parecen muy complicados. Hacemos solo \\"la\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:53:11,000","to":"00:53:14,000"},"offsets":{"from":3191000,"to":3194000},"text":" Sí, sí, lo hacemos espacito."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:53:14,000","to":"00:53:18,000"},"offsets":{"from":3194000,"to":3198000},"text":" Y después hacemos \\"ju\\", que significa \\"él\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:53:18,000","to":"00:53:21,000"},"offsets":{"from":3198000,"to":3201000},"text":" Es el nombre de la esencia, \\"ju\\" significa \\"él\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:53:21,000","to":"00:53:23,000"},"offsets":{"from":3201000,"to":3203000},"text":" ¿Sí?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:53:23,000","to":"00:53:25,000"},"offsets":{"from":3203000,"to":3205000},"text":" No, no, no. ¿Cómo?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:53:25,000","to":"00:53:27,000"},"offsets":{"from":3205000,"to":3207000},"text":" No, no hay que sentarse en una manera."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:53:30,000","to":"00:53:33,000"},"offsets":{"from":3210000,"to":3213000},"text":" Bueno, vamos a seminar las manos aquí."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:53:33,000","to":"00:53:40,000"},"offsets":{"from":3213000,"to":3220000},"text":" Bueno, nos ponemos \\"comos\\" y \\"chaldad\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:53:40,000","to":"00:53:44,000"},"offsets":{"from":3220000,"to":3224000},"text":" No sé si me escuchan bien ahí."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:53:44,000","to":"00:53:45,000"},"offsets":{"from":3224000,"to":3225000},"text":" ¿Hay alguien bonitado?"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:53:45,000","to":"00:53:50,000"},"offsets":{"from":3225000,"to":3230000},"text":" Bueno, y \\"chaldad\\" que tiene \\"cuchando\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:53:50,000","to":"00:53:53,000"},"offsets":{"from":3230000,"to":3233000},"text":" Bueno, nos ponemos \\"comos\\"."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:53:59,000","to":"00:54:03,000"},"offsets":{"from":3239000,"to":3243000},"text":" Vamos a hacer, primero, dos respiraciones,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:54:03,000","to":"00:54:07,000"},"offsets":{"from":3243000,"to":3247000},"text":" llenando bien el pulmón, los pulmones, bien hacia arriba."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:54:07,000","to":"00:54:10,000"},"offsets":{"from":3247000,"to":3250000},"text":" Y después vamos a dejar que salga el aire suavemente."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:54:10,000","to":"00:54:12,000"},"offsets":{"from":3250000,"to":3252000},"text":" Vamos a hacerlo tres veces."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:54:12,000","to":"00:54:13,000"},"offsets":{"from":3252000,"to":3253000},"text":" Sígueme a mí."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:54:13,000","to":"00:54:17,000"},"offsets":{"from":3253000,"to":3257000},"text":" Contenemos ahí el aire."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:54:17,000","to":"00:54:24,000"},"offsets":{"from":3257000,"to":3264000},"text":" Y dejamos que salga suave, suave, suave."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:54:24,000","to":"00:54:27,000"},"offsets":{"from":3264000,"to":3267000},"text":" Mientras salga el aire, el cuerpo se relaja."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:54:28,000","to":"00:54:33,000"},"offsets":{"from":3268000,"to":3273000},"text":" De vuelta, contenemos el aire."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:54:33,000","to":"00:54:37,000"},"offsets":{"from":3273000,"to":3277000},"text":" Y exhalamos suavemente."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:54:37,000","to":"00:54:43,000"},"offsets":{"from":3277000,"to":3283000},"text":" Todo el cuerpo comienza a blandarse."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:54:43,000","to":"00:54:49,000"},"offsets":{"from":3283000,"to":3289000},"text":" Y una vez más, contenemos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:54:49,000","to":"00:54:54,000"},"offsets":{"from":3289000,"to":3294000},"text":" Y suavemente exhalamos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:54:55,000","to":"00:55:02,000"},"offsets":{"from":3295000,"to":3302000},"text":" Y a partir de ahora, respiramos suavemente con la nariz."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:55:02,000","to":"00:55:11,000"},"offsets":{"from":3302000,"to":3311000},"text":" Dejamos que el aire vente y salga suavemente."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:55:11,000","to":"00:55:15,000"},"offsets":{"from":3311000,"to":3315000},"text":" Los ojos pueden estar entreabiertos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:55:15,000","to":"00:55:19,000"},"offsets":{"from":3315000,"to":3319000},"text":" Pueden buscar un punto, mirar fijo un punto."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:55:19,000","to":"00:55:21,000"},"offsets":{"from":3319000,"to":3321000},"text":" Pueden cerrarlos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:55:23,000","to":"00:55:30,000"},"offsets":{"from":3323000,"to":3330000},"text":" Y en todo momento, el aire entra y sale suave."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:55:30,000","to":"00:55:41,000"},"offsets":{"from":3330000,"to":3341000},"text":" Sentimos un alivio profundo en ese aire que nos nutre,"},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:55:41,000","to":"00:55:46,000"},"offsets":{"from":3341000,"to":3346000},"text":" que nos da vida, que nos sostiene."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:55:53,000","to":"00:56:03,000"},"offsets":{"from":3353000,"to":3363000},"text":" Ahora vamos a poner nuestra atención en nuestro cuerpo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:56:03,000","to":"00:56:08,000"},"offsets":{"from":3363000,"to":3368000},"text":" Vamos a sentir nuestras manos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:56:08,000","to":"00:56:12,000"},"offsets":{"from":3368000,"to":3372000},"text":" Una mano a la derecha."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:56:15,000","to":"00:56:25,000"},"offsets":{"from":3375000,"to":3385000},"text":" Vamos a sentir como cada vez que respiramos y exhalamos, la mano se hace blanda."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:56:25,000","to":"00:56:38,000"},"offsets":{"from":3385000,"to":3398000},"text":" El antebrazo se afloja, la mano derecha subimos por el hombro."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:56:41,000","to":"00:56:45,000"},"offsets":{"from":3401000,"to":3405000},"text":" Sintiendo como entra el aire y sale el aire."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:56:45,000","to":"00:56:51,000"},"offsets":{"from":3405000,"to":3411000},"text":" Ahora vamos a la mano izquierda."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:56:51,000","to":"00:57:01,000"},"offsets":{"from":3411000,"to":3421000},"text":" Se afloja la mano, el antebrazo y el hombro."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:57:05,000","to":"00:57:11,000"},"offsets":{"from":3425000,"to":3431000},"text":" El aire sigue entrando suave y sale suave, con cada exhalación."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:57:11,000","to":"00:57:20,000"},"offsets":{"from":3431000,"to":3440000},"text":" Estamos más quietos, más calmados, más serenos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:57:20,000","to":"00:57:30,000"},"offsets":{"from":3440000,"to":3450000},"text":" Subimos por nuestro cuello y exhalamos y se afloja todo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:57:32,000","to":"00:57:43,000"},"offsets":{"from":3452000,"to":3463000},"text":" La mandíbula se afloja, la cara se hace suave la frente."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:57:43,000","to":"00:57:51,000"},"offsets":{"from":3463000,"to":3471000},"text":" Nuestra cabeza también se afloja."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:57:51,000","to":"00:57:58,000"},"offsets":{"from":3471000,"to":3478000},"text":" Empezamos a hacernos livianos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:58:03,000","to":"00:58:14,000"},"offsets":{"from":3483000,"to":3494000},"text":" La grede entra suave, sale suave, cada vez estamos más y más y más flojos."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:58:14,000","to":"00:58:28,000"},"offsets":{"from":3494000,"to":3508000},"text":" Las piernas se aflojan también, se hacen suaves, soltamos todas las tensiones."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:58:32,000","to":"00:58:39,000"},"offsets":{"from":3512000,"to":3519000},"text":" Y ahora, sentimos nuestra frente."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:58:39,000","to":"00:58:46,000"},"offsets":{"from":3519000,"to":3526000},"text":" Se hace ancha, se hace calma, se expande."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:58:46,000","to":"00:58:57,000"},"offsets":{"from":3526000,"to":3537000},"text":" Y ahora vamos a nuestro corazón suavemente, sin esfuerzo."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:59:01,000","to":"00:59:04,000"},"offsets":{"from":3541000,"to":3544000},"text":" Como si nuestro corazón fuese el que está respirando."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:59:04,000","to":"00:59:10,000"},"offsets":{"from":3544000,"to":3550000},"text":" Entra ese aire y sale ese aire."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:59:10,000","to":"00:59:22,000"},"offsets":{"from":3550000,"to":3562000},"text":" Se expande nuestro corazón respirando y se relaja exhalando."},{"timestamps":{"from":"00:59:28,000","to":"00:59:31,000"},"offsets":{"from":3568000,"to":3571000},"text":" Y ahora vamos a empezar."}]'),m={systeminfo:e,model:o,params:t,result:s,transcription:a};export{m as default,o as model,t as params,s as result,e as systeminfo,a as transcription};
